  (text "GENERATED FILE — drawn by tools/gen_schematic.py from\ntools/design.py (the netlist source of truth). Never edit\nby hand: edit design.py, regenerate, re-run the gates\n(check_netlist.py, ERC, DRC --schematic-parity)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 153.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "0447e57a-5a34-53fa-bbc0-1951b1f1d67f"))
  (text "RULE 1 — SW1 OFF before plugging ANY USB.\nThe load-share block was meant to retire this rule; the\n2026-07-26 review shows it cannot (state 4, §4.1/§4.3).\nThe rule stays until §4.4 passes on an assembled board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 176.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "be2dd136-a35f-5481-a2ad-81829e0ae5a8"))
  (text "RULE 2 — charge with SW1 OFF (TP4056 cannot\nterminate into a load)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 196.85 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "a15a8c88-3728-58a2-b664-c163de0b5393"))
  (text "RULE 3 — one USB at a time: charger-USB = charging,\nmodule-USB = development, SW1 ON only with no USB." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 203.835 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "10a0eb7f-0966-5cc5-a552-3fadbcf89a7c"))
  (text "SHOW BUILD (plan A, §4.5): bridge JP1 and DO NOT FIT\nQ1, Q2, U1, D1, D2, R7, R8. Never leave D2 fitted on a\nJP1-bridged board — the charger's USB would land on the\ncell raw, upstream of the switch." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "f6e35008-78f9-5a93-b4e6-0bda1cf64d47"))
  (text "BREADBOARD DELTA (wiring.md): no load-share block —\nOUT+ → switch → 5V pin direct. VBAT_RAW = BAT_PLUS,\nVBAT_SW ≈ VLOAD. All signal wiring is identical." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "7cb77c90-5295-5b09-98db-b15d02d533a9"))
  (text "TO-92 LEAD ORDER (U1, Q2): vendors number the same\npackage opposite ways (TL431 onsemi vs TI; BC557 C-B-E\nvs E-B-C) — check the datasheet of the part actually\nbought (pcb.md §5)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 252.73 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "079c344c-48d2-52a3-930a-b7ba7f34330c"))
